    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math> is equal to"
